Debug.Assert(OLD(Count) = y + 1);
</code>

The assert statement checks the equality of the old value of Count (assuming the Count is the number of elements in the list before the elements are added) with the sum of y and 1 (assuming y is the number of elements that are to be added to the list). This is because after each loop iteration, the count increments by 1.
